            "review_title": "Review at Torishin Yakitori Tokyo Asakusa",
            "review_text": "Hilts\nDa Nang, Vietnam533 contributions\n3\nAverage food for reasonable prices\nJul 2026 • Solo\nMost dishes were cooked well, but unfortunately, I didn’t get that grilled taste, which is strange, as everything is cooked to order.\n\nImportant Information:\n- All prices on the app exclude local taxes.\n- For my order, they added 18%.\n\nService:\n- As previously mentioned, everything is cooked to order, so please be patient.\n- All food and drink needs to be ordered on an app. Not great when your battery is dead.\n- Rating: 4/5\n\nAtmosphere:\n- During my visit they played some nice upbeat music.\n- Seating: High-back plastic chairs.\n- To keep you cool, they have a few portable fans.\n- If you need to use the toilet, you need to leave the restaurant and go round the back. Not very convenient, especially in the evening.\n- Rating: 4/5\n\nMy Order:\n\n- 1 x Potato Salad with Wiener\n- The portion size was quite small, but it tasted good.\n- Price: 50K\n- Rating: 4/5\n\n- 1 x Grilled Pork with Ginger\n- The flavour was okay, but it was quite dry.\n- Price: 110K\n- Rating: 4/5\n\n- 1 x Grilled Pork Belly\n- The pork was dry and had no flavour.\n- Price: 25K\n- Rating: 3/5\n\n- 1 x Teriyaki Chicken\n- The chicken was tender and moist, but didn’t have much flavour.\n- Price: 82K\n- Rating: 3/5\n\n- 1 x Chicken Liver Skewer\n- The liver was soft and tender, but again not much flavour.\n- Price: 9K\n- Rating: 3/5\n\n- 1 x Chicken Heart Skewer\n- The heart was soft and tender, but again not much flavour.\n- Price: 9K\n\n- 1 x Chicken Gizzard Skewer\n- Again, no flavour\n- Price: 9K\n- Rating: 3/5\n\n- 1 x Mushroom Skewer\n- Price: 9K\n- Rating: 4/5\n\n- 1 x Okra Skewer\n- Some pieces were nice, but some were slimy.\n- Price: 9K\n- Rating: 3/5\n\n- 1 x Chicken Breast\n- It was very dry and didn’t have much flavour.\n- Price: 29K\n- Rating: 3/5\n\n- 1 x Bia Hoi Hanoi (1 Litre)\n- Price: 105K\n- No ice bucket was provided. I don’t drink warm beer.\n- Rating: 2/5\n\nOverall Rating: 3/5\nRead more\nWritten September 22, 2026",
